%C − Embedded API.

%C [options]

DESCRIPTION
%C is a resource manager that provides a unified interface
for Embedded Controller (EC) chips. It initialises the target EC
chip and exposes a resource manager interface for client access.

options:
    -d chip_name
        Specify the EC chip to initialise. Name is case-insensitive.
        Accepted values: mec, mec170x, f81804, fintek

    -p priority
        Change kernel assigned priority

    -v verbosity
        Set the verbosity level.

example:
Launch the server targeting a MEC-compatible EC:

%C -d mec
